icate-authority.mdx","Crea tu primera CA","Crea una raíz de evaluación y comprueba su certificado antes de emitir.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority",{"_98":134},"platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx",{"_73":136,"_80":91,"_75":137,"_85":138,"_94":-7,"_12":139,"_96":140},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx","Emite y verifica un certificado","Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_98":141},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_73":143,"_80":119,"_94":-7,"_75":144},"es:_1","Conceptos",{"_73":146,"_80":91,"_75":147,"_85":148,"_94":-7,"_12":149,"_96":150},"es:platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx","Modelo de confianza","Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_98":151},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_73":153,"_80":91,"_75":154,"_85":155,"_94":-7,"_12":156,"_96":157},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_98":158},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_73":160,"_80":119,"_94":-7,"_75":161},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_73":163,"_80":91,"_75":164,"_85":165,"_94":-7,"_12":166,"_96":167},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_98":168},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_73":170,"_80":91,"_75":171,"_85":172,"_94":-7,"_12":173,"_96":174},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que estable